        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we are licensed to manufacture a conventional RCP with an HDPE liner to protect concrete pipe from corrosion, and a lined manhole system, which integrates a monolithic precast concrete base with a plastic liner that is chemically resistant to raw sewage gases.",
